        ['id' => 'what', 'h2' => 'What the startup score measures', 'html' => <<<'HTML'
<p>The 100X score is a two-minute startup health check for founders: a quick way to score your startup and answer one question: how 100X is your startup today? Ten questions cover what tends to decide whether an early company can grow ten or a hundred times: how far along the product is, whether people pay, how fast you are growing, whether users stay, who is building it, how customers find you, how much runway you have, what protects you from copycats, how big the market is and how often you ship. Each answer adds points, and the total appears on a meter from 0X to 100X.</p>
