<p>Growth carries the most weight because steady month-on-month growth is the clearest sign that something is working. Revenue and retention follow: money shows people value the product, and retention shows they keep valuing it. Funding sits lowest on purpose. Runway buys time, but raising money doesn't prove that customers want what you make.</p>
