<h3>The four bands</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Early (under 30X):</strong> the idea is still being tested. Most questions are about finding out whether anyone wants it.</li>
<li><strong>Traction (30X to 59X):</strong> real users and usually some revenue, often with one or two weak spots.</li>
<li><strong>Scaling (60X to 84X):</strong> the basics work and the job is to grow them without breaking anything.</li>
<li><strong>Breakout (85X and above):</strong> the company shows most of the signs of a fast-growing business.</li>
